ABIL_DESCS_.update({'RallyingGuard': 'You + your party take 20 % less, mobs turn on you. Sprint - grab allies as you run. Air - on landing. Crouch - Hold the Line.', 'ShieldShockwave': 'Walk - a cone that stuns and hits. Sprint - Charging Slam (steps in). Air - Ground Pound on landing. Crouch - Ring (all around).', 'IronChain': 'Walk - drag the enemy you look at to you. Sprint - meet halfway. Air - yank it up. Crouch - Anchor (farther, rooted).', 'Challenge': 'Walk - the enemy you look at must fight you: you take less, its hits reflect. Sprint - step in. Air - on landing. Crouch - Duel.', 'GuardiansOath': 'Link an ally: you take part of their damage, and less yourself. Sprint - the nearest + speed. Air - the most hurt. Crouch - more.', 'Enrage': 'You + allies near you (picked once) deal more, growing for 10 s. Sprint - grab more. Air - on landing. Crouch - Lone Rage (you).', 'Whirlwind': 'Spin: hit everything around you, heal from it. Sprint - Cyclone Charge. Air - a slam on landing. Crouch - Grinder (rooted).', 'Earthsplitter': 'Walk - a shockwave line that knocks up (stronger at low Health). Sprint - longer. Air - Crater on landing. Crouch - Fissure.', 'BloodFrenzy': 'Toggle: every hit a stack (damage + speed), allies near you half. Sprint - 3 stacks. Air - 2. Crouch - Blood Bank.', 'WarlordsBanner': 'A banner: damage + defence in range, kills keep it up, falls if you leave. Sprint - ahead. Air - where you land. Crouch - Rooted.', 'PinningShot': 'Walk - an arrow that roots + Marks the first 2. Sprint - on the move. Air - 3 arrows below you. Crouch - Steady Aim (farther).', 'RapidFire': '15 arrows down your look in 3 s. Sprint - while running. Air - hover while firing. Crouch - Braced (faster, stronger, rooted).', 'ExplosiveArrow': 'Your next arrow hit explodes for 2x. Sprint - Quick Fuse. Air - Mortar (bigger, knock-up). Crouch - Set Charge (later, 2.5x).', 'ArrowRain': 'Walk - arrows rain where you look (slow, root, Mark). Sprint - behind you. Air - below you. Crouch - Kneeling Volley.', 'HuntersNet': 'Walk - a net that roots + Marks where you look. Sprint - a strip behind you. Air - below you. Crouch - Set Trap (hidden).'})   # 0.1.24
