m = B.manifest("SkyyClasses", VERSION, "SkyWynn classes: Archer, Warrior, Mage, Berserker, Priest, Assassin, Monk, Spellblade. Your class decides your weapons and your combat skill; every class gets a kit with its basic weapon, straight into the hotbar (a Warrior's shield into the off-hand); Archers claim free arrows once a day; Priests heal their party and own the Healing Totem (heal and ability lines go to the SkyyHud notification feed when the player picks Feed); the wand heal orb and traversal lock-ons go through class:fn:heal / class:fn:ally; class abilities on the Ability 2 / 3 keys (Hytale 0.7 runes) and /cast, levelling by use with modifiers (Mage Meteor, Mana Barrier, Frost Nova, Starfall or Arcane Beam; Priest Sacred Heal, Shield Bubble, the Guardian Spirit passive, Sanctuary or Martyr's Grace; Monk Flowing Form, Palm Strike, Cyclone Kick, Hundred Fists or Still Water; Assassin Cloak + First Strike, Toxin, God Killer, Vanishing Act; Warrior Rallying Guard, Shield Shockwave, Iron Chain, Challenge or Guardian's Oath; Berserker Enrage, Whirlwind, Earthsplitter, Blood Frenzy or Warlord's Banner; Archer Pinning Shot, Rapid Fire, Explosive Arrow, Arrow Rain or Hunter's Net; Spellblade Arcane Breach, Elemental Imbue, Sunder, Rift Cleave or Shattering Arc with Momentum and element statuses; sprinting, mid-air and crouch shapes; crouch = your alts; /cast page). /class to choose, locked per profile with SkyyProfiles. Zero dependencies (SkyyProfiles, SkyyParty, SkyySkills and SkyyCoins optional).", PKG + ".SkyyClassesPlugin")
